      "message": "This file could use a main config option PLATFORM_EC_USBA.  This should be done as a separate CL or a bug opened.\n\nmenuconfig PLATFORM_EC_USBA\n    bool \"USB Type-A support\"\n    help\n       Enable USB Type A ports...\n       \nif PLATFORM_EC_USBA\n\n# existing USB_A options...\n\nchoice PLATFOR_EC_USBA_PORT_POWER_TYPE\n\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_USB_PORT_POWER_DUMB\n\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_USB_PORT_POWER_SMART\nendchoice\n\nendif",
